(7533178, 1204641, 32948, '<td valign="top">it is a  SAAB SeaEye Panther XT, a small work class ROV (remote operated vehicle), the prototype from 2008.  It is what we (RPM Nautical Foundation www.rpmnautical.org a non-profit (US 501 c 3) research and educational organization that performs maritime archaeological research in the Mediterranean)use for identification of targets we find with our hydrographic serveys.  Goals for RPMNF is to assist Mediterranean countries with the location, identification, assessment, and research of their submerged cultural material so that these important cultural resources can be protected for future generations.</td>', 'it is a  SAAB SeaEye Panther XT, a small work class ROV (remote operated vehicle), the prototype from 2008.  It is what we (RPM Nautical Foundation www.rpmnautical.org a non-profit (US 501 c 3) research and educational organization that performs maritime archaeological research in the Mediterranean)use for identification of targets we find with our hydrographic serveys.  Goals for RPMNF is to assist Mediterranean countries with the location, identification, assessment, and research of their submerged cultural material so that these important cultural resources can be protected for future generations.', '2017-09-05 06:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7533287, 1204657, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Your miniatures have served you well here Marcel, they are very colourful. You have made the composition much more convincing by getting right down to the level of the toys together with a well chosen aperture to make us feel that they have stopped their skating for a quick photo before they go back to their fun.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well Your miniatures have served you well here Marcel, they are very colourful. You have made the composition much more convincing by getting right down to the level of the toys together with a well chosen aperture to make us feel that they have stopped their skating for a quick photo before they go back to their fun.', '2017-09-05 18:29:36.000000', NULL, 0),
